# A PvP victim with the Spill Blood task loses it and gains the 60-second
# recently-fragged tag on a frag-eligible death. Death saves the victim and returns
# them to the account menu before the outcome completes, so both must already be in
# that save and still hold after re-entry (#1063). 10000000 is SPILL_BLOOD.
staff  Spillstaff
actor  Spiller  class=WARRIOR level=34
actor  Bleeder  class=CLERIC  level=33 race=ORC racewar=EVIL affect=TAG_EPIC_ERRAND:10000000

Bleeder> score
Bleeder? Current task: .*spill enemy blood

Spillstaff> setbit char Bleeder hit 5
# A round lands about one unarmed blow in 4.5 seconds, and a fumble can end the
# fight, so keep ordering the attack ("already fighting" is harmless) for minutes.
until Spiller /is dead!/ max 400 kill orc
Bleeder? You just lost [0-9.]+ frags![\s\S]*very pleased with YOUR &?\+?R?blood

login Bleeder
Bleeder! Current task: .*spill enemy blood
# The tag came back from the death save with its remaining time, under a minute.
Spillstaff> stat char bleeder
Spillstaff? ^ +[1-5]?[0-9]\S* seconds,.* - fragged victim
# ...and still expires: poll until stat stops listing it.
until Spillstaff /\A(?![\s\S]*fragged victim)[\s\S]*Bleeder/ max 600 stat char bleeder
